(7161113, 1099330, 43565, '<td valign="top">Great way to add text!</td>', 'Great way to add text!', '2014-01-22 11:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161116, 1099344, 173844, '<td valign="top">First, this is a fabulous black and white ---  great depth of field, composition, textures and poses.  Exemplifying the song, the boys absolutely depict teenage boredom and perhaps angst.  In any case, that''s my take on it.  The stairs offer a dark outlet.  Curiously, there are three sneakers with the left-hand boy and the right-hand boy, situated as he is, presents a single shoe.  The graphics look terrific.  My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'First, this is a fabulous black and white ---  great depth of field, composition, textures and poses.  Exemplifying the song, the boys absolutely depict teenage boredom and perhaps angst.  In any case, that''s my take on it.  The stairs offer a dark outlet.  Curiously, there are three sneakers with the left-hand boy and the right-hand boy, situated as he is, presents a single shoe.  The graphics look terrific.  My favorite in the challenge.', '2014-01-22 12:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161128, 1099385, 131871, '<td valign="top">Creative!! I love it!</td>', 'Creative!! I love it!', '2014-01-22 12:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161135, 1099172, 131871, '<td valign="top">I love this!</td>', 'I love this!', '2014-01-22 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161142, 1099341, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully colorful, cleverly graphic magical mystery tour!  I like.</td>', 'Wonderfully colorful, cleverly graphic magical mystery tour!  I like.', '2014-01-22 13:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161145, 1099423, 173844, '<td valign="top">A tour de force sci-fi fantasy.  The under-skin wire is really well done, though the plug-into-the-wall power source seems a bit impractical ---  unless it''s just for a recharge.  The gallery of outlets, eyes wide open and mouths agape, provide a nice comic touch.  I also love how the patch of color seen when she unzips her skin is echoed in her bangles.</td>', 'A tour de force sci-fi fantasy.  The under-skin wire is really well done, though the plug-into-the-wall power source seems a bit impractical ---  unless it''s just for a recharge.  The gallery of outlets, eyes wide open and mouths agape, provide a nice comic touch.  I also love how the patch of color seen when she unzips her skin is echoed in her bangles.', '2014-01-22 14:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161150, 1099244, 173844, '<td valign="top">What a clever take on the title.  The lighting and coloration are perfect.  The tooth is fabulous.  The casual pose of the man on the beach, just right.  An altogether very fine image.</td>', 'What a clever take on the title.  The lighting and coloration are perfect.  The tooth is fabulous.  The casual pose of the man on the beach, just right.  An altogether very fine image.', '2014-01-22 14:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161157, 1099052, 173844, '<td valign="top">A busy, beautiful picture.  Caught between dream and ''reality''.  The two figures balance each other so well.  The well-distributed reds and browns work harmoniously, nicely setting off the dark-clothed man and the woman in a turquoise top.  It''s a wonderful caught moment.  I''m also amused to see the bike seat out the window behind the man turn him into a wind-up toy.  A favorite of mine.</td>', 'A busy, beautiful picture.  Caught between dream and ''reality''.  The two figures balance each other so well.  The well-distributed reds and browns work harmoniously, nicely setting off the dark-clothed man and the woman in a turquoise top.  It''s a wonderful caught moment.  I''m also amused to see the bike seat out the window behind the man turn him into a wind-up toy.  A favorite of mine.', '2014-01-22 14:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161160, 1099168, 173844, '<td valign="top">There''s a singular joy in realizing that the dark object to the right is a compass, shining light on the title and offering satisfaction, indeed, to the viewer.  To continue, the overall image imparts a murky unease and irresolution that are psychologically troubling.  Well done.... I guess.</td>', 'There''s a singular joy in realizing that the dark object to the right is a compass, shining light on the title and offering satisfaction, indeed, to the viewer.  To continue, the overall image imparts a murky unease and irresolution that are psychologically troubling.  Well done.... I guess.', '2014-01-22 14:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161165, 1099387, 173844, '<td valign="top">This image itself would push a record to the top of the charts.  Who can resist it?  Funny and clever with a great graphic layout.  The eye contact really grabs the viewer.  The seemingly moldy and scratchy background is quite suitable.  I like the border, too.</td>', 'This image itself would push a record to the top of the charts.  Who can resist it?  Funny and clever with a great graphic layout.  The eye contact really grabs the viewer.  The seemingly moldy and scratchy background is quite suitable.  I like the border, too.', '2014-01-22 14:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161166, 1099168, 27421, '<td valign="top">Back in Black....LOL to dark on my end...</td>', 'Back in Black....LOL to dark on my end...', '2014-01-22 14:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161194, 1099344, 167332, '<td valign="top">I like it. a bit over processed but good.</td>', 'I like it. a bit over processed but good.', '2014-01-22 15:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161206, 1099423, 58667, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image and a creative idea! To me I would <i>almost</i> say the only thing out of place is the pants - everything else looks robotic.</td>', 'This is an interesting image and a creative idea! To me I would almost say the only thing out of place is the pants - everything else looks robotic.', '2014-01-22 16:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161208, 1099420, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully atmospheric.  Followed by one''s memories through the fog or overlaid bokeh.  A surprising amount of color has been used in the background, and it looks good.  The image is very reminiscent of the movie "The Third Man".</td>', 'Wonderfully atmospheric.  Followed by one''s memories through the fog or overlaid bokeh.  A surprising amount of color has been used in the background, and it looks good.  The image is very reminiscent of the movie "The Third Man".', '2014-01-22 16:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
