(7161287, 1099387, 96751, '<td valign="top">Those are the chubbiest squirrels I''ve ever seen.</td>', 'Those are the chubbiest squirrels I''ve ever seen.', '2014-01-22 19:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161289, 1099155, 96751, '<td valign="top">There''s something rather freaky about this!!  I love the portrait, and the ghostly transparency. The hair color is a bit odd, but I feel like the text overpowers the gentleness of the image, and is not "mystical" enough.</td>', 'There''s something rather freaky about this!!  I love the portrait, and the ghostly transparency. The hair color is a bit odd, but I feel like the text overpowers the gentleness of the image, and is not "mystical" enough.', '2014-01-22 19:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161290, 1099278, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Not sure I understand why that line is on the left. My eye keeps going over there. The colors, the lighting, the editing - I haven''t gotten through the challenge but this is likely to be on the podium.  <br/> <br/>PS - I''d kill for that hair....</td>', 'Beautiful. Not sure I understand why that line is on the left. My eye keeps going over there. The colors, the lighting, the editing - I haven''t gotten through the challenge but this is likely to be on the podium.   PS - I''d kill for that hair....', '2014-01-22 19:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161291, 1099257, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love this concept, and the lighting in the oven is perfect. Just not sure why the burner controls were included.  It''s clear this is an oven, even without them.</td>', 'I love this concept, and the lighting in the oven is perfect. Just not sure why the burner controls were included.  It''s clear this is an oven, even without them.', '2014-01-22 19:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
