(7161307, 1099378, 96751, '<td valign="top">Based on the title, I''m going to have to guess this is mundi...<br/> <br/>This is a moderately interesting image, but I don''t see the connection to the challenge in any way. The title might have helped, but the one used doesn''t not indicate a band or an identifiable song. Thus, to me it DNMC.<br/> <br/>Just critiquing the image itself, it is clean and nicely lit. However, the composition is a little erratic, and without any context, I''m not sure what the garbage is a commenting on.</td>', 'Based on the title, I''m going to have to guess this is mundi... This is a moderately interesting image, but I don''t see the connection to the challenge in any way. The title might have helped, but the one used doesn''t not indicate a band or an identifiable song. Thus, to me it DNMC. Just critiquing the image itself, it is clean and nicely lit. However, the composition is a little erratic, and without any context, I''m not sure what the garbage is a commenting on.', '2014-01-22 19:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
