(7161430, 1099423, 131264, '<td valign="top">Brilliant as usual. With a lot of truth in it for our time. I`m a kind of the digital revolution (I grow up with the techniques which rules our world today, they are mainly part of my job) but I don`t agree with every aspect of them. Most young people today don`t reflect the consequences of the new parallel digital world.</td>', 'Brilliant as usual. With a lot of truth in it for our time. I`m a kind of the digital revolution (I grow up with the techniques which rules our world today, they are mainly part of my job) but I don`t agree with every aspect of them. Most young people today don`t reflect the consequences of the new parallel digital world.', '2014-01-23 04:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161445, 1099180, 66709, '<td valign="top">Finally</td>', 'Finally', '2014-01-23 07:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161470, 1099172, 173844, '<td valign="top">Phantasmagoric explosion of a bus coming right at you!  And there''s a disinterested looking person in the front window!  It looks great and is totally album cover material.  No doubts what kind of music is inside ---  blow your mind back to devonian times.</td>', 'Phantasmagoric explosion of a bus coming right at you!  And there''s a disinterested looking person in the front window!  It looks great and is totally album cover material.  No doubts what kind of music is inside ---  blow your mind back to devonian times.', '2014-01-23 10:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161473, 1098989, 173844, '<td valign="top">Must be for a double album.  But I love this image, blown highlights and all.  Not sure why.  Maybe it''s the vintage feel or the hodgepodge of lines.  Heavy grain or blizzard? ....don''t care.</td>', 'Must be for a double album.  But I love this image, blown highlights and all.  Not sure why.  Maybe it''s the vintage feel or the hodgepodge of lines.  Heavy grain or blizzard? ....don''t care.', '2014-01-23 10:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7161474, 1099366, 173844, '<td valign="top">In addition to being a fine photo -- harmonious colors, interesting detail and unusual perspective -- it''s really funny.  And it''s the only entry that creatively situates the cover in an environment.</td>', 'In addition to being a fine photo -- harmonious colors, interesting detail and unusual perspective -- it''s really funny.  And it''s the only entry that creatively situates the cover in an environment.', '2014-01-23 10:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
