(7161991, 1098841, 173844, '<td valign="top">Handsome diorama of an everyday scene in an exotic country.  The brown coloration complements the overall feel, with two nicely contrasting light areas.  The Chinese characters looked funny to me until I realized the photo has been switched left to right.</td>', 'Handsome diorama of an everyday scene in an exotic country.  The brown coloration complements the overall feel, with two nicely contrasting light areas.  The Chinese characters looked funny to me until I realized the photo has been switched left to right.', '2014-01-24 13:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
