(7162743, 1098841, 102278, '<td valign="top">Love the biro text!</td>', 'Love the biro text!', '2014-01-26 09:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162781, 1099385, 173844, '<td valign="top">A group of blasé young people (the band?) casually watching and taking cell phone shots of our planet being invaded by chew toys.  And it looks great!  Overall magenta coloration ties the image together.  I think they''ll perk up when the giant rottweilers arrive in the next wave.</td>', 'A group of blasé young people (the band?) casually watching and taking cell phone shots of our planet being invaded by chew toys.  And it looks great!  Overall magenta coloration ties the image together.  I think they''ll perk up when the giant rottweilers arrive in the next wave.', '2014-01-26 12:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162785, 1099195, 173844, '<td valign="top">Ordinary enough scene that at the same time is quite entrancing.  That''s the eye of a good photographer.  There''s a story here that is tantalizingly unknowable.  The granulation of the figures is interesting, but I find its presence on the street between the left and middle person distracting.</td>', 'Ordinary enough scene that at the same time is quite entrancing.  That''s the eye of a good photographer.  There''s a story here that is tantalizingly unknowable.  The granulation of the figures is interesting, but I find its presence on the street between the left and middle person distracting.', '2014-01-26 12:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162789, 1098972, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative way to take a strong, moody portrait and make it into something new and visually exciting.  Deep blue coloration heightens the mysterious atmosphere.</td>', 'Wonderfully creative way to take a strong, moody portrait and make it into something new and visually exciting.  Deep blue coloration heightens the mysterious atmosphere.', '2014-01-26 12:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162793, 1099423, 12076, '<td valign="top">Spectacular.</td>', 'Spectacular.', '2014-01-26 13:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162794, 1099278, 173844, '<td valign="top">A lovely, crisp image that fills the space through the creative uplifting of her hair.  A pretty model with an engaging poutiness.  Two focal points ---  her beflowered head and the lotus in her hands.  Terrific choice of background.  Love that eyebrow.</td>', 'A lovely, crisp image that fills the space through the creative uplifting of her hair.  A pretty model with an engaging poutiness.  Two focal points ---  her beflowered head and the lotus in her hands.  Terrific choice of background.  Love that eyebrow.', '2014-01-26 13:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162809, 1099203, 173844, '<td valign="top">Upbeat, well-designed album cover.  I suspect the music within is catchy and fun.</td>', 'Upbeat, well-designed album cover.  I suspect the music within is catchy and fun.', '2014-01-26 14:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162811, 1099376, 173844, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like looking at this character, but it''s just so beautifully repugnant.  Turtle neck sweater ... perfect touch.</td>', 'I don''t really like looking at this character, but it''s just so beautifully repugnant.  Turtle neck sweater ... perfect touch.', '2014-01-26 14:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162812, 1099125, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely in its minimalist way, with an engaging sense of focus.</td>', 'Lovely in its minimalist way, with an engaging sense of focus.', '2014-01-26 14:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162813, 1099413, 173844, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nicely presented.  I can''t decide whether or not I like the break in symmetry of the face on the right.</td>', 'Good idea, nicely presented.  I can''t decide whether or not I like the break in symmetry of the face on the right.', '2014-01-26 14:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162814, 1099180, 173844, '<td valign="top">Is this a real headstone?  Humor in the cemetery, does the heart good.  If the snow was brighter it would actually detract from the mood.  Overall, this is a fun, uplifting image that I enjoy looking at.</td>', 'Is this a real headstone?  Humor in the cemetery, does the heart good.  If the snow was brighter it would actually detract from the mood.  Overall, this is a fun, uplifting image that I enjoy looking at.', '2014-01-26 14:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162816, 1099258, 173844, '<td valign="top">Placing these shoes as they are is just so bizarrely outrageous that they startle with delight.  Wonderful idea. And the background structure has a nice composition.  Topnotch album art.</td>', 'Placing these shoes as they are is just so bizarrely outrageous that they startle with delight.  Wonderful idea. And the background structure has a nice composition.  Topnotch album art.', '2014-01-26 14:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162817, 1099422, 173844, '<td valign="top">Strikingly strange.  That''s a good thing.  Beautifully developed idea that aptly illustrates the record title.  Nice follow through of blues.</td>', 'Strikingly strange.  That''s a good thing.  Beautifully developed idea that aptly illustrates the record title.  Nice follow through of blues.', '2014-01-26 14:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162818, 1099368, 173844, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I can totally see this on an album cover.  Contemporary feel.</td>', 'Well done.  I can totally see this on an album cover.  Contemporary feel.', '2014-01-26 14:51:28.000000', NULL, 1);
