(7162820, 1099152, 173844, '<td valign="top">Unpromising scene made very attractive through the tilt and the striped shadows.  Very impressive.  Now it commands attention and is esthetically rewarding.  The graphic serves well too.</td>', 'Unpromising scene made very attractive through the tilt and the striped shadows.  Very impressive.  Now it commands attention and is esthetically rewarding.  The graphic serves well too.', '2014-01-26 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162825, 1099383, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I like the effects you used on the figures.</td>', 'Nice image.  I like the effects you used on the figures.', '2014-01-26 15:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162834, 1099330, 173844, '<td valign="top">Quirky, fresh amalgam.  Is it, "I''ve forgotten how to eat a banana"?  Whatever, it''s brightly engaging.</td>', 'Quirky, fresh amalgam.  Is it, "I''ve forgotten how to eat a banana"?  Whatever, it''s brightly engaging.', '2014-01-26 15:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162835, 1099073, 173844, '<td valign="top">Classic look.  Sensitive pose.  Was the top of the guitar left off on purpose?  I''d kind of like to see it.</td>', 'Classic look.  Sensitive pose.  Was the top of the guitar left off on purpose?  I''d kind of like to see it.', '2014-01-26 15:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162836, 1099102, 173844, '<td valign="top">Beautiful oil paint effect.  The colors work well together.  Just lovely.</td>', 'Beautiful oil paint effect.  The colors work well together.  Just lovely.', '2014-01-26 15:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162838, 1099000, 173844, '<td valign="top">Terrific, funky feel.  The huge moon and the stars shining through are most interesting.  I love the appropriate positioning of Orion''s belt.</td>', 'Terrific, funky feel.  The huge moon and the stars shining through are most interesting.  I love the appropriate positioning of Orion''s belt.', '2014-01-26 15:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162842, 1099155, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely mystical feel to her emerging face.</td>', 'Nicely mystical feel to her emerging face.', '2014-01-26 15:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162843, 1099257, 173844, '<td valign="top">The vibrant cactus within the oven is a powerful image.  Juxtaposition at its best.</td>', 'The vibrant cactus within the oven is a powerful image.  Juxtaposition at its best.', '2014-01-26 15:34:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162845, 1099398, 173844, '<td valign="top">What I really like here is the flatness of these mountains.  I don''t see how the moon is ''bad'' but for the unusual coloration.</td>', 'What I really like here is the flatness of these mountains.  I don''t see how the moon is ''bad'' but for the unusual coloration.', '2014-01-26 15:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162847, 1099392, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and perspective, with that surprise kiss.  I also like the graininess of the image.</td>', 'Excellent composition and perspective, with that surprise kiss.  I also like the graininess of the image.', '2014-01-26 15:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162848, 1099145, 173844, '<td valign="top">Not sure why I like this, but I do.  It might have to do with the engaging title.</td>', 'Not sure why I like this, but I do.  It might have to do with the engaging title.', '2014-01-26 15:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162855, 1099294, 173844, '<td valign="top">Enchantingly interesting, watery image.  Just enough detail to lift it out  of abstraction.  I''m enjoying looking at this.</td>', 'Enchantingly interesting, watery image.  Just enough detail to lift it out  of abstraction.  I''m enjoying looking at this.', '2014-01-26 16:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162861, 1099310, 173844, '<td valign="top">Enjoyable image, sort of comic, sort of sad.  The frog is well-placed on the rock, before the setting sun.  The expression seems to say, "Whither goest I?"</td>', 'Enjoyable image, sort of comic, sort of sad.  The frog is well-placed on the rock, before the setting sun.  The expression seems to say, "Whither goest I?"', '2014-01-26 16:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162862, 1099213, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done abstract with bright colors and a strong sense of movement.  My own personal taste would incline me to less white space, but of course that''s neither here nor there.</td>', 'Very nicely done abstract with bright colors and a strong sense of movement.  My own personal taste would incline me to less white space, but of course that''s neither here nor there.', '2014-01-26 16:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162863, 1099393, 173844, '<td valign="top">For the title, this is a very evocative surrealistic image.  There''s an interesting imagination at work here.  Fine piece of work.</td>', 'For the title, this is a very evocative surrealistic image.  There''s an interesting imagination at work here.  Fine piece of work.', '2014-01-26 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162864, 1098877, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very assertive image.  Heavy metal fans won''t be disappointed.</td>', 'Very assertive image.  Heavy metal fans won''t be disappointed.', '2014-01-26 16:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162865, 1099309, 173844, '<td valign="top">Fun image that pulls out all the stops.  Celebratory, in its own way.  The reds and purples work well.</td>', 'Fun image that pulls out all the stops.  Celebratory, in its own way.  The reds and purples work well.', '2014-01-26 16:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7162868, 1098830, 173844, '<td valign="top">Interesting, and it works for me.  Enjoyably disorienting.</td>', 'Interesting, and it works for me.  Enjoyably disorienting.', '2014-01-26 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
