(7164014, 1099418, 115814, '<td valign="top">Extra points for the terrific homage to an iconic cover and underrated work. I can''t help but wonder how different the music would be 28 years later.</td>', 'Extra points for the terrific homage to an iconic cover and underrated work. I can''t help but wonder how different the music would be 28 years later.', '2014-01-28 10:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164017, 1099387, 115814, '<td valign="top">I always wondered what the Chipmunks would do without that controlling fiend, Alvin, to push them around...</td>', 'I always wondered what the Chipmunks would do without that controlling fiend, Alvin, to push them around...', '2014-01-28 10:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164018, 1099385, 115814, '<td valign="top">Don''t buy this CD! It''s a trap!</td>', 'Don''t buy this CD! It''s a trap!', '2014-01-28 11:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164019, 1099069, 63218, '<td valign="top">This was fun to look at. I was enjoying the textural detail, thinking it sure looks like graffiti on a wall, then some of the detail in the corners came to my attention &amp; I started thinking this IS graffiti on a wall!  :D  That explains why the ''text'' looks so much a contributing part of the composition. Well done.</td>', 'This was fun to look at. I was enjoying the textural detail, thinking it sure looks like graffiti on a wall, then some of the detail in the corners came to my attention & I started thinking this IS graffiti on a wall!  :D  That explains why the ''text'' looks so much a contributing part of the composition. Well done.', '2014-01-28 11:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164022, 1099344, 115814, '<td valign="top">This is a mixed bag for me. I love the image and processing - it would stand well on it''s own. There''s just to much going on with the copy text. Still a top choice from me.</td>', 'This is a mixed bag for me. I love the image and processing - it would stand well on it''s own. There''s just to much going on with the copy text. Still a top choice from me.', '2014-01-28 11:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164025, 1099179, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like the 3D effect on the drum, it stands out nicely, very eye-catching. I searched google for the Handphibians--sounds like an interesting band.</td>', 'I like the 3D effect on the drum, it stands out nicely, very eye-catching. I searched google for the Handphibians--sounds like an interesting band.', '2014-01-28 11:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164028, 1099278, 63218, '<td valign="top">I like it. In a music store, I''d buy it just for the cover art.</td>', 'I like it. In a music store, I''d buy it just for the cover art.', '2014-01-28 11:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164030, 1099203, 115814, '<td valign="top">What a fun entry! Love the cover, but I''ve got to say the overall musical oeuvre and style of webdpc is hard to peg - the proverbial box of chocolates or Bertie Botts Every Flavor beans.</td>', 'What a fun entry! Love the cover, but I''ve got to say the overall musical oeuvre and style of webdpc is hard to peg - the proverbial box of chocolates or Bertie Botts Every Flavor beans.', '2014-01-28 11:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164032, 1099066, 115814, '<td valign="top">Clever... and a bit disturbing. I like it.</td>', 'Clever... and a bit disturbing. I like it.', '2014-01-28 11:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164035, 1099129, 63218, '<td valign="top">Evocative. I think this must be the cover art for a soundtrack. One of those epic stores written in the 19th century...like Moby Dick (I had to google it).</td>', 'Evocative. I think this must be the cover art for a soundtrack. One of those epic stores written in the 19th century...like Moby Dick (I had to google it).', '2014-01-28 11:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164037, 1099294, 63218, '<td valign="top">Sharp &amp; dreamy, edgy &amp; romantic.</td>', 'Sharp & dreamy, edgy & romantic.', '2014-01-28 11:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164038, 1099418, 63218, '<td valign="top">I love what the shadows are doing in this. The impact of that gaze is difficult to describe.</td>', 'I love what the shadows are doing in this. The impact of that gaze is difficult to describe.', '2014-01-28 11:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164039, 1099177, 115814, '<td valign="top">A lovely image. Maybe a bit busy for my taste, and not particularly reminiscent or evocative of the the Byrds to me.</td>', 'A lovely image. Maybe a bit busy for my taste, and not particularly reminiscent or evocative of the the Byrds to me.', '2014-01-28 11:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164040, 1099188, 115814, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this and liking it better each time.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this and liking it better each time.', '2014-01-28 11:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164044, 1099330, 115814, '<td valign="top">Nicky Holloway, I presume?</td>', 'Nicky Holloway, I presume?', '2014-01-28 11:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164053, 1099393, 115814, '<td valign="top">Hmm.... you might say the fabric of reality is tearing apart. Nicely done!</td>', 'Hmm.... you might say the fabric of reality is tearing apart. Nicely done!', '2014-01-28 11:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164054, 1098841, 115814, '<td valign="top">Clever, well conceived homage... I think I''ll stick with the bike, though.</td>', 'Clever, well conceived homage... I think I''ll stick with the bike, though.', '2014-01-28 11:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164059, 1099129, 115814, '<td valign="top">Terrific effect. A top pick from me! "Those devils are good fellows, too." I think Patrick Shea would approve!</td>', 'Terrific effect. A top pick from me! "Those devils are good fellows, too." I think Patrick Shea would approve!', '2014-01-28 11:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164060, 1099278, 115814, '<td valign="top">Nice. Not particularly evocative MB''s music, but a stunning image.</td>', 'Nice. Not particularly evocative MB''s music, but a stunning image.', '2014-01-28 11:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164074, 1099345, 115814, '<td valign="top">I love everything about this but the graphic design of the word "Amy." Still one of my favorites - I want to hear this music! [Iron and Wine reference?]</td>', 'I love everything about this but the graphic design of the word "Amy." Still one of my favorites - I want to hear this music! [Iron and Wine reference?]', '2014-01-28 12:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7164077, 1098972, 115814, '<td valign="top">Really clever concept. and well executed to boot.</td>', 'Really clever concept. and well executed to boot.', '2014-01-28 12:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
