(7165245, 1099257, 174090, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tnun:</b></div><hr/><i> and I thought the shoe one was good. welcome to dpc. please continue. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thanks for the comment, I really appreciate it. I will definitely continue. My camera is in the hands of a thief now though, but I will get a new one, no doubt.</td>', 'Originally posted by tnun: and I thought the shoe one was good. welcome to dpc. please continue.  Thanks for the comment, I really appreciate it. I will definitely continue. My camera is in the hands of a thief now though, but I will get a new one, no doubt.', '2014-01-29 21:16:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165246, 1099278, 48702, '<td valign="top"><b>Very nice Judi, she is so pretty!!</b></td>', 'Very nice Judi, she is so pretty!!', '2014-01-29 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165283, 1099423, 37719, '<td valign="top">There have been a few ''cyborg'' type shots in the past.  However, none were quite as well done as this one.  Well thought out composition, excellent lighting, color and contrast balance in processing, and blending.  Flawless really.<br/> <br/>The concept seems to be futuristic obviously (I have to admit I have no idea who Daft Punk is), but there is a certain relevancy to the present depicted here in an oblique way.  Perhaps it is my imagination.<br/> <br/>Flaws - yes, mostly if not entirely in the reflection, but who cares?  That is not the subject here and only plays a minor supporting role.  Very well done!</td>', 'There have been a few ''cyborg'' type shots in the past.  However, none were quite as well done as this one.  Well thought out composition, excellent lighting, color and contrast balance in processing, and blending.  Flawless really. The concept seems to be futuristic obviously (I have to admit I have no idea who Daft Punk is), but there is a certain relevancy to the present depicted here in an oblique way.  Perhaps it is my imagination. Flaws - yes, mostly if not entirely in the reflection, but who cares?  That is not the subject here and only plays a minor supporting role.  Very well done!', '2014-01-29 21:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165368, 1099294, 30982, '<td valign="top">Avg (commenters): 8.0000 - and that from a dozen comments.  Very nice!!</td>', 'Avg (commenters): 8.0000 - and that from a dozen comments.  Very nice!!', '2014-01-30 02:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165531, 1099278, 96751, '<td valign="top">I believe "mythical" is the operative word.  Something very unique and hypnotizing about this glorious image. Congrats on the (predicted) ribbon :)</td>', 'I believe "mythical" is the operative word.  Something very unique and hypnotizing about this glorious image. Congrats on the (predicted) ribbon :)', '2014-01-30 10:36:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165680, 1099278, 60173, '<td valign="top">I really like this image in theory. The colors are great, composition is great, all kinds of great things happening. <br/> <br/>However, what''s going on with the hair that crosses over her body? There''s chunks of hair appearing and disappearing all over the place. If you were to reuse this image for another application, I would suggest taking a closer look at those areas and making sure the hair connects to her head rather than appearing to come from her palm or pit, heh.</td>', 'I really like this image in theory. The colors are great, composition is great, all kinds of great things happening.  However, what''s going on with the hair that crosses over her body? There''s chunks of hair appearing and disappearing all over the place. If you were to reuse this image for another application, I would suggest taking a closer look at those areas and making sure the hair connects to her head rather than appearing to come from her palm or pit, heh.', '2014-01-30 16:38:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165693, 1099278, 27133, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by aliqui:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this image in theory. The colors are great, composition is great, all kinds of great things happening. <br/> <br/>However, what''s going on with the hair that crosses over her body? There''s chunks of hair appearing and disappearing all over the place. If you were to reuse this image for another application, I would suggest taking a closer look at those areas and making sure the hair connects to her head rather than appearing to come from her palm or pit, heh. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hi Aliqui<br/> <br/>I was waiting for someone to mention that.  I thought it would be brought up during voting but it wasn''t!  I was fully aware of her hair across her body when I edited.  I did make it solid but it seemed to cut her in half...I liked the effect when it was opaque so I left it like that.  I preferred the gentle effect it had on the overall image in comparison to either solid or no hair at all.  I hope that makes sense?</td>', 'Originally posted by aliqui: I really like this image in theory. The colors are great, composition is great, all kinds of great things happening.  However, what''s going on with the hair that crosses over her body? There''s chunks of hair appearing and disappearing all over the place. If you were to reuse this image for another application, I would suggest taking a closer look at those areas and making sure the hair connects to her head rather than appearing to come from her palm or pit, heh.   Hi Aliqui I was waiting for someone to mention that.  I thought it would be brought up during voting but it wasn''t!  I was fully aware of her hair across her body when I edited.  I did make it solid but it seemed to cut her in half...I liked the effect when it was opaque so I left it like that.  I preferred the gentle effect it had on the overall image in comparison to either solid or no hair at all.  I hope that makes sense?', '2014-01-30 17:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165711, 1099418, 127021, '<td valign="top">I''ll ecco beata''s comment completely...</td>', 'I''ll ecco beata''s comment completely...', '2014-01-30 18:00:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7165759, 1099278, 59029, '<td valign="top">I wasn''t trying to imply anything about her hands, Judi. I have somewhat good-sized paws for a woman, too. It''s just the angles that, to me, make her hands - esp in a portrait showing delicacy and grace - a little too noticeable.  That''s all.  If you choose to be offended, then I''m very sorry.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2014-01-30 19:13:20.</i></td>', 'I wasn''t trying to imply anything about her hands, Judi. I have somewhat good-sized paws for a woman, too. It''s just the angles that, to me, make her hands - esp in a portrait showing delicacy and grace - a little too noticeable.  That''s all.  If you choose to be offended, then I''m very sorry.', '2014-01-30 19:11:58.000000', '2014-01-30 19:13:20.000000', 0),
(7165909, 1099423, 122678, '<td valign="top">this is unbelievable!<br/>Congrats!!!</td>', 'this is unbelievable!Congrats!!!', '2014-01-30 21:21:18.000000', NULL, 0),
