(7166159, 1099423, 153374, '<td valign="top">As Pharell stated in the Grammy Awards, "The Robots (Daft Punk) would like to thank their fans for their support".<br/> <br/>This totally represents Daft Punk in that special way that they use their music. This picture IMHO is just pure BRILLIANT.<br/> <br/>I am in pure AWE on this picture.<br/> <br/>A very well deserved Blue Ribbon. Congratulations!!!<br/> <br/></td>', 'As Pharell stated in the Grammy Awards, "The Robots (Daft Punk) would like to thank their fans for their support". This totally represents Daft Punk in that special way that they use their music. This picture IMHO is just pure BRILLIANT. I am in pure AWE on this picture. A very well deserved Blue Ribbon. Congratulations!!! ', '2014-01-31 08:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
